%% SQ-05 Administrative review, document verification and approval guard
%% Controllers: Admin\ApplicationReviewController, Admin\DocumentVerificationController
%% Service: ScholarshipApplicationWorkflowService
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor A as Administrator
    participant RC as ApplicationReviewController
    participant WF as ApplicationWorkflowService
    participant DB as MariaDB
    participant DV as DocumentVerificationController
    participant FS as Private storage
    participant NS as NotificationService

    A->>RC: GET /admin/scholarship-applications?status=submitted
    RC->>DB: SELECT applications with student, scholarship, status
    RC-->>A: paginated review queue + filters

    A->>RC: GET /admin/scholarship-applications/{app}
    RC->>DB: load application, documents, status histories
    RC-->>A: detail with allowed transitions and document actions

    A->>DV: PATCH /admin/documents/{doc}/verify (status, remarks)
    DV->>DV: VerifyDocumentRequest — remarks required on reject
    DV->>DB: UPDATE application_documents (verification_status, remarks, verified_by, verified_at)
    DV->>NS: notify student (document_approved / document_rejected)
    DV-->>A: refreshed document list

    A->>RC: POST /admin/scholarship-applications/{app}/transition (to, remarks)
    RC->>WF: transition(application, target, actor, remarks)
    WF->>WF: getAllowedTransitions(current)
    alt target not in transition table (SM-01)
        WF-->>RC: WorkflowTransitionException
        RC-->>A: 302 back with "transition not allowed" message
    else target = approved
        WF->>DB: checkApprovalReadiness(app)
        alt any required requirement lacks a verified document
            WF-->>RC: reasons[]
            RC-->>A: approval refused with per-requirement reasons
        else all required documents verified
            WF->>DB: BEGIN transaction
            WF->>DB: UPDATE status = approved (row lock)
            WF->>DB: INSERT application_status_histories
            WF->>DB: COMMIT
            WF->>NS: notify student application_approved
            RC-->>A: redirect to detail, status approved
        end
    else other permitted target
        WF->>DB: BEGIN transaction
        WF->>DB: UPDATE status (row lock)
        WF->>DB: INSERT application_status_histories (previous, new, actor, remarks)
        WF->>DB: COMMIT
        WF->>NS: notify student of the new status
        RC-->>A: redirect to detail
    end

    Note over A,DV: Downloading a document streams from private storage<br/>only after the policy confirms admin or owner (FR-DOC-03).
